msgstr "Situs web Anda tidak menggunakan HTTPS"

#: wp-admin/includes/class-wp-site-health.php:1485
msgid "Learn more about why you should use HTTPS"
msgstr "Pelajari lebih lanjut tentang mengapa Anda harus menggunakan HTTPS"

#: wp-admin/includes/class-wp-site-health.php:1621
msgid "Securely communicating between servers are needed for transactions such as fetching files, conducting sales on store sites, and much more."
msgstr "Komunikasi antar server yang aman diperlukan untuk fungsi transaksi seperti mengambil berkas, memproses penjualan di situs e-commerce, dan sebagainya."

